/* ── Element spec ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * image plane      → Group, true 3D rectangle tilted about X (rotation.x = θ,
 *                    scale.y = s); the camera's cabinet-oblique shear turns it
 *                    into the printed parallelogram (horizontal top/bottom,
 *                    sides leaning right). No geometry is sheared.
 * mural photograph → procedural CanvasTexture, sliced per tile via custom UVs
 * window tile      → PlaneGeometry(1,1) + MeshBasicMaterial(map), group scaled
 *                    to the tile rect, shrunk by the white gap
