 * tile outline     → LineSegments unit square, #111111
 * white gap        → empty space between shrunken, outward-pushed tiles
 * highlight        → PlaneGeometry(1,1) white 0.18 + LineSegments #FFD24A
 * attention        → LineSegments #1E6FE0, all-pairs of token centres in tile
 * shift markers    → Points #FF6A00, pulsing, tokens that changed window
