/* ── Element spec ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * six image planes → Group per panel, TRUE 3D rectangle tilted about X so the
 *                    camera's cabinet-oblique shear renders the printed
 *                    parallelogram (no geometry is pre-sheared)
 * mural photograph → procedural CanvasTexture 480×1000 (tall frame, as printed),
 *                    sliced per tile via UVs
 * window tile      → PlaneGeometry(1,1)+MeshBasicMaterial(map), shrunk by GAP so
 *                    a WHITE gap separates windows
 * tile outline     → black backing PlaneGeometry BORD larger on every side
 * token grid (8×8) → LineSegments #3B3B3B per tile (panel a) has none)
 * highlight        → white PlaneGeometry 0.18 opacity + amber thickened border
 * attention links  → LineSegments #1E6FE0, only on click (toggleable)
 * shift markers    → Points #FF6A00, OFF by default (toggleable)
 * ellipsis '· · ·' → 3 × SphereGeometry(0.033) #222 between c|d and e|f
